KITTI sample data
-----------------
The point clouds in velodyne_pcd/ are frames from sequence 00 of the KITTI
Vision Benchmark Suite odometry dataset (https://www.cvlibs.net/datasets/kitti/),
converted to PCD format. The KITTI data is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/). Please cite:

  A. Geiger, P. Lenz, C. Stiller and R. Urtasun. Vision meets Robotics:
  The KITTI Dataset. International Journal of Robotics Research (IJRR), 2013.
